          {
            "url": "https://www.supplychaindive.com/news/us-threatens-raise-tariffs-200-billion-chinese-imports/529179/",
            "title": "China warns it could retaliate with tariffs on $60B",
            "snippets": [
              "The announcement comes after the U.S. said it will consider raising tariffs from 10% to 25% on $200 billion of imports from China.",
